# Issue tracker

`project_tracker: github` — default for this repo. Use GitHub Issues and `gh` for issue creation from CE plans.

## When to apply

- Creating issues from `ce-plan` / `ce-brainstorm` handoff
- Triaging, linking PRs to issues, or reading open work
- User mentions Linear, GitHub Issues, or ticket IDs

## GitHub (default)

- Prefer `gh issue create`, `gh pr create`, `gh pr view` when `gh` is installed and authenticated.
- Persist tracker choice in root `AGENTS.md` as `project_tracker: github` when the user confirms.

## Linear (when configured)

- Requires Linear MCP in `.cursor/mcp.json` or `LINEAR_API_KEY` via `mcp-remote https://mcp.linear.app/mcp`.
- Use Linear tools for find/create/update issues when the user or plan explicitly references Linear.
- Do not assume Linear is available — check MCP tools before calling.

## Issue content

- Title: short, action-oriented.
- Body: problem, scope, acceptance criteria, links to plans in `<root>/plans/` when relevant.
